    "detailed_description": "<strong>Saturday Super Day is a point and click exploratory choose your own adventure game that was prototyped in PowerPoint.</strong><br>You play as Bobbi who wakes on a mid 90s Saturday morning with a mission: To reach the computer lab at Scuttlebutt High School and back up an important project before the school servers get wiped for the summer.<br><br>Embark on a lovingly handcrafted journey through Olympia WA. That's been packed to the brim with explorable content and characters.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A vast, mid 90s accurate world to enjoy at your own pace.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 30 different environments to explore.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique hand-drawn art style based on 90s animation.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intuitive drag and drop controls.</li></ul>",
